<title>USA: P&amp;G sues Tristar over deodorant.</title>
<headline>P&amp;G sues Tristar over deodorant.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Procter &amp; Gamble Co said on Thursday it filed a lawsuit against Tristar Corp in an effort to stop it from selling its Everscent High Performance deodorant products.</p>
<p>The company said the suit claims Tristar's product infringes on the design and trademark of Old Spice High Endurance deodorant.</p>
<p>P&amp;G said it is seeking monetary damages and asking that Tristar, based in San Antonio, Texas, remove all the infringing deodorant product from store shelves.</p>
</text>
